Z||000007||pHoOl||03-04-2001||02:54 AM||||Hey sqoach, <P>Not sure by you response if you were looking to get rid of it or sell it, but i've thought about doing that mod myself.<P>How did you make yours?  I was sketching on paper how i would want the cutout, but never got past that far.  Designed it while at work and bored, then had to go back to college in the fall.  I'm assuming that there would be some clearance to slide a thin piece of black plastic in behind the lens.  Maybe this summer i'll take it apart and look.  Wow, i rambled, anyway, wonderin how you did it.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000008||sqoach||03-04-2001||04:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pHoOl:<BR><B>Hey sqoach, <P>Not sure by you response if you were looking to get rid of it or sell it, but i've thought about doing that mod myself.<P>How did you make yours?  I was sketching on paper how i would want the cutout, but never got past that far.  Designed it while at work and bored, then had to go back to college in the fall.  I'm assuming that there would be some clearance to slide a thin piece of black plastic in behind the lens.  Maybe this summer i'll take it apart and look.  Wow, i rambled, anyway, wonderin how you did it.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>well, i was bored one day and decided to try it cuz i saw it on rodney's site.<P>you know those little booklet things in cd cases? well, i found a black one and used that. i got on the computer and found a font that looked pretty good in all caps. then i found the right size font. (this took a few attemps to get it just right) when i found the right size, i realized it was going to be all bunched up in the middle, so i put a space between each letter. then i print it out on regular paper. with the black piece of thin cardboard (or whatever it is) you got from the cd, i traced the outline of the brake light gasket and cut it out. then i taped the paper onto that cutout and very carefully cut along the lines of the font. you have to remember to not completely cut out the centers of the "R" and the "O" or it won't look right. <P>anyway, you get the idea. i'll take a pic of just that little "mask" if you want me to.||||reg||10
Z||000009||TheFiero64||03-05-2001||12:37 PM||||I made mine out of some thin black cardboard. I cut the centers out totally and used clear tape to center them. I thought it was an original Idea at the time. Then soon after I saw the ones on Rodney's page<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Jan02^02.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
Z||000010||Tigger||03-05-2001||01:05 PM||||I cut the centers out and used clear tape for mine too.  Don't have pictures of it but it says: WHOA!||||reg||1
Z||000011||Haze_Performance||03-05-2001||01:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by gabriel:<BR><B>What years had the 3rd light?<BR>I don't have one on my 85.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I think 3rd brake lights became standard on all US cars in 1986.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A>||||reg||6
